<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $66-3/4 (FIM 327.10).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $66-3/4 (FIM 327.10).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR</p>
<p>closed $1 higher $66-3/4 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 327.10 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Monday, Nokia A closed down 1.20 markka at</p>
<p>322.00 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down</p>
<p>$0-3/4 at $36 on Wall Street. The price equals about 88.20</p>
<p>markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 1.10 markka at 89.10.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended $1-1/4 higher at $21-7/8</p>
<p>in New York on Monday. The price equals about 107.20 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Monday, Rauma closed up 3.50 markka at</p>
<p>106.00.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 235</p>
</text>
